.TH SFWC 1 "" "sfwc" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sfwc \- simple floating Wayland compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sfwc
.RB [ \-s
.IR command ]
.RB [ \-h ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sfwc
is a small floating (stacking) Wayland compositor built on wlroots. It runs on a TTY
(DRM/KMS, libseat) or as a window of another Wayland compositor or X11 server. It has
server-side decorations, themes, animations, workspaces and layer-shell support for bars,
launchers and wallpapers, and is configured with one INI-style file, see
.BR sfwc.conf (5).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-s " command"
Run
.I command
(through
.BR "/bin/sh \-c" )
once the compositor is up, with WAYLAND_DISPLAY set. The compositor does not exit when the command ends.
.TP
.B \-h
Show usage.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SFWC_CONFIG
Path of the config file. Default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/sfwc/sfwc.conf, else ~/.config/sfwc/sfwc.conf.
.TP
.B SFWC_LOG_LEVEL
silent, error, info (default) or debug.
.TP
.B SFWC_NO_ANIMATIONS
Set to 1 to switch animations off.
.TP
.B SFWC_NO_THEME_APPLY
Set to 1 to skip rendering the theme templates.
.TP
.B SFWC_TEMPLATES
Colon separated template directories for
.BR sfwc\-theme\-apply (1).
.TP
.B XCURSOR_THEME, XCURSOR_SIZE
Cursor theme and size.
.TP
.B WLR_BACKENDS, WLR_RENDERER
wlroots overrides (for example WLR_BACKENDS=headless for testing).
.SH DEFAULT KEYS
Alt is the default modifier (the
.B mod
setting). Alt+Return opens the terminal, Alt+q closes the window, Alt+Tab cycles windows,
Alt+f maximizes, Alt+F11 toggles fullscreen, Alt+m minimizes (Alt+Shift+m restores),
Alt+1..4 switch workspace, Alt+Shift+1..4 move the window, Alt+o / Alt+Shift+o move the window /
the focus to the next output, Alt+Shift+r reloads the config, Alt+Escape quits. Alt+Left drag moves
and Alt+Right drag resizes a window. Ctrl+Alt+F1..F12 switch the virtual terminal.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sfwc/sfwc.conf
Configuration (an example ships as /usr/share/sfwc/sfwc.conf).
.TP
.I ~/.config/sfwc/themes/NAME.theme
User themes.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sfwc.conf (5),
.BR sfwc\-theme\-apply (1)
